OL,3,GNEWSACharlotte Church to 'pause'
OL,4,Awellness retreat and consider its
OL,5,Afuture
OL,6,
OL,7,FCharlotte Church will "pause" her
OL,8,Fwellness retreat from December to
OL,9,F"germinate new dreams for the future",
OL,10,Fthe star has shared.
OL,12,FThe Dreaming, based in Rhydoldog House
OL,13,Fnear Rhayader, Powys, offered retreats
OL,14,Faimed at helping people reconnect with
OL,15,Fnature and spirituality.
OL,17,FThe singer-songwriter bought the former
OL,18,Fhome of fashion designer Laura Ashley
OL,19,Fin 2021, with its renovation later
OL,20,Ffeaturing in a Discovery Channel
OL,21,Fdocumentary series.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
