OL,3,GNEWSACharlotte Church to 'pause'
OL,4,Awellness retreat and consider its
OL,5,Afuture
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn a statement on social media, the
OL,8,Fteam said the retreat had hosted more
OL,9,Fthan 3,000 guests over the last five
OL,10,Fyears, and wanted to "reassess" what it
OL,11,Fshould offer in a changing world.
